      "placeholders": [],
      "translate": true,
      "zh": "宝石是嵌在大多数隧道岩壁中的鲜艳晶体。不同的宝石分布在不同生物群系中，只有 Ruby 似乎随处可见。",
      "segments": [
        {
          "color": "§d",
          "text": "Gemstones ",
          "zh": "宝石"
        },
        {
          "color": "§7",
          "text": "are brightly colored shards embedded in the walls of most ",
