    {
      "id": "nov06_hollows_structures",
      "context": "本轮实测补译；Mining",
      "text": "On your adventures you will find many structures. Some abandoned, some not. Structures such as these can contain Epic loot or dangerous foes so always be on the look out.",
      "raw": "§7On your §aadventures §7you will find many structures. Some abandoned, some not. Structures such as these can contain §5Epic loot §7or §cdangerous foes §7so always be on the look out.",
      "placeholders": [],
      "translate": true,
      "zh": "在冒险途中，你会遇到各种建筑，有些已被废弃，有些仍有住客。里面可能藏着史诗级战利品，也可能潜伏着危险敌人，务必时刻保持警惕。",
      "segments": [
        {
          "color": "§7",
          "text": "On your ",
          "zh": "在"
        },
        {
          "color": "§a",
          "text": "adventures ",
          "zh": "冒险"
        },
        {
          "color": "§7",
          "text": "you will find many structures. Some abandoned, some not. Structures such as these can contain ",
          "zh": "途中，你会遇到各种建筑，有些已被废弃，有些仍有住客。里面可能藏着"
        },
        {
          "color": "§5",
          "text": "Epic loot ",
          "zh": "史诗级战利品"
        },
        {
          "color": "§7",
          "text": "or ",
          "zh": "，也可能潜伏着"
        },
        {
          "color": "§c",
          "text": "dangerous foes ",
          "zh": "危险敌人"
        },
        {
          "color": "§7",
          "text": "so always be on the look out.",
